{"1912410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Minecraft Dungeons II", "steam_appid": 1912410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-order now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order Minecraft Dungeons II today and get 2 additional hero skins, the Twisted cape, and the Twisted chicken pet! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/77acd6a54fbb04621ddafe9266bbf1de.avif?t=1787819593\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras_big/77acd6a54fbb04621ddafe9266bbf1de.webp?t=1787819593 width=1560 height=862 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up with the Deluxe Edition, featuring the Soul cape, Blub pet, 4 hero skins, and DLC 1 &amp; 2 available as released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/97cba4b16f3cba94399b9f54f5a93750.avif?t=1787819593\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras_big/97cba4b16f3cba94399b9f54f5a93750.webp?t=1787819593 width=1560 height=825 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop the pickaxe, grab a sword, and charge into a thrilling new adventure in Minecraft Dungeons II. Journey through unexplored lands and mysterious locations, in a quest to stop a new evil from causing chaos in not one, but two worlds! Clash with menacing foes in explosive encounters and fight your way through hordes of mobs that will do everything in their power to stop you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/c092590ac458d8f8fa455f677b1d6186.poster.avif?t=1787819593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/c092590ac458d8f8fa455f677b1d6186.webm?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/c092590ac458d8f8fa455f677b1d6186.mp4?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a new, challenging threat that puts your combat skills to the test like never before </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/017d102ee7be9217b161124acfa41f17.poster.avif?t=1787819593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/017d102ee7be9217b161124acfa41f17.webm?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/017d102ee7be9217b161124acfa41f17.mp4?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an all-new chapter in the Minecraft Dungeons saga that takes you across the Overworld... and beyond </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.poster.avif?t=1787819593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.webm?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.mp4?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect hero with legendary gear, including a wide range of weapons, armor, and artifacts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.poster.avif?t=1787819593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.webm?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.mp4?t=1787819593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with new and old friends in a party of up to four players and smash your foes with the power of teamwork</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop the pickaxe, grab a sword, and charge into a thrilling new adventure in Minecraft Dungeons II. Journey through unexplored lands and mysterious locations, in a quest to stop a new evil from causing chaos in not one, but two worlds! Clash with menacing foes in explosive encounters and fight your way through hordes of mobs that will do everything in their power to stop you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/c092590ac458d8f8fa455f677b1d6186.poster.avif?t=1787819593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic